<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 7.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>International prices for milling and Durum wheat were mixed, with a continuing slow export market and good winter wheat planting conditions in the U.S. Central Plains, the Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Australian milling wheat prices were unchanged while Durum rose A$1.00. Prices, FOB, in A$ per tonne:</p>
